libfprint-egis0576-tod (0.4.4-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial Ubuntu TOD module packaging. Builds the egis0576 driver as a
    standalone libfprint-2/tod-1 module against the stock Ubuntu
    libfprint-2-tod-dev headers. Does not replace libfprint-2-2.
  * Build one .deb per series with build-series.sh (noble, resolute): a
    noble-built .deb's auto-generated libgusb2 dependency does not resolve
    on 26.04, which renamed that runtime package to libgusb2a. The version
    each series' build stamps (a ~24.04 or ~26.04 suffix, applied by the
    script and not committed here) also keeps a release upgrade moving a
    user onto the resolute build instead of leaving them on noble's. See
    packaging/README.md.

